# License — NEVER commit these to source control
private.pem          # Trintz signing key — keep in secrets vault, never ship
master.key           # Legacy symmetric key — replaced by RSA; keep if you have old deployments
license.dat          # Client-side activated license — machine-specific, not source
issued_licenses.log  # Internal Trintz issuance log — contains customer data
license_serial.txt   # Auto-incrementing serial counter — internal Trintz use only
# NOTE: public.pem is intentionally NOT listed here — it is safe to commit and
#       is required by the Render deployment for license_manager to import cleanly.
